/T (In the future, this project can be enhanced by adding multi-class detection \(people, vehicles, objects\), privacy features like face blurring, edge device support, real-time alerts via mobile or email, and animated heatmaps of people flow. Predictive analytics can help forecast crowd surges, and building a mobile app will enable remote monitoring. Integration with IoT devices for automated actions, customizable report options, and a scalable architecture for large venues will make the system even more powerful and flexible for various real-world applications.)
