/T (This project not only improves crowd management and safety, but also supports data-driven decision making for administrators with real-time insights and detailed reports. The robust admin panel gives full control over cameras, zones, users, and alerts, making it easy to adapt the system to any public environment. With planned enhancements like multi-class detection, predictive analytics, and IoT integration, it is well-positioned to meet future requirements and handle a wide variety of complex scenarios efficiently. Overall, the solution is scalable, customizable, and provides the foundation for next-generation smart monitoring systems.)
